  </ul>
  <p>These are the things that make use of Vocele illegitimate. Practising a lot is not one of them: heavy ordinary personal use, within your allowance, is exactly what your plan is for, and it will never on its own cause us to limit or close your account.</p>

  <h2>AI-generated content</h2>
  <p>Conversations, corrections, translations, pronunciation feedback, level estimates, stories and exercises are produced by artificial-intelligence models. Because of how those models work, the output <strong>may be inaccurate, incomplete or unsuitable for your purpose</strong>, may contain confidently stated errors, and may be similar or identical to output another learner receives. We give no warranty as to its accuracy or fitness, and your reliance on it is at your own risk.</p>
  <p>Vocele is a learning tool. It is not a certified assessment, and any level or score it shows you is an estimate for your own practice — not an academic credential, diploma, qualification or proof of proficiency for any employer, school or authority. It is not a substitute for professional translation or for legal, medical, financial, educational or immigration advice. Do not rely on it where accuracy matters.</p>

